## Total cost
Total cost covers two venue days plus 660 hotel room nights (220 rooms for 3 nights).

data totals = city,total cost; Lisbon,145900; Prague,119480; Vienna,168340; Krakow,97720; Seville,131140; Athens,116660; Dublin,182440
chart hbar totals y=total cost labels unit=€ title="Total cost for 220 people"

## Trade-offs
- **Krakow** is the cheapest at €97,720, but its largest room seats 190, fewer than the 220 attendees. It is out.
- **Vienna** and **Dublin** have the shortest flights or the largest rooms, but they are the two most expensive options.
- **Athens** is cheaper than Prague, but its flight is 1.6 hours longer.

## Recommendation
We recommend **Prague**. It costs only €2,820 more than Athens, and the flight is 1.6 hours shorter. Its largest room seats 260 attendees, so everyone fits.
